  "limitations": [
    "Control centres and shared gauge layouts are estimated from V36-976021. The earlier CM-103 transcription supplies group labels, face extents and gauge diameters where the layouts coincide. Drawing sheet says DO NOT SCALE PRINT.",
    "Apollo 9 added a general-purpose timer. The mission records do not establish its installation on this main panel; the existing main-panel mission and event timers are present in both drawings.",
    "The upper Panel 2 docking probe control group is retained in the as-drawn position. The lower Panel 2 flight qualification recorder switch is deleted, leaving two high-gain antenna switches.",
    "Switch shapes, projections and the registration to the later hull survey are estimates. Side panels, individual circuit legends and the internal mechanism are omitted. Instruments are static."
